          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Delay": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 4294967295
        },
        "Quest": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "RepliesList": {
          "type": "list",
          "value": [
            {
              "__struct_id": 0,
              "Active": {
                "type": "resref",
                "value": ""
              },
              "Index": {
                "type": "dword",
                "value": 4
              },
              "IsChild": {
                "type": "byte",
                "value": 0
              }
            },
            {
              "__struct_id": 1,
              "Active": {
                "type": "resref",
                "value": ""
              },
              "Index": {
                "type": "dword",
                "value": 5
              },
              "IsChild": {
                "type": "byte",
                "value": 0
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "Script": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Sound": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*He takes the parchment back and turns it over once, not opening it.* Unbroken. *A pause.* Most come back to me with it opened, or with a very good account of why it is not on them at all. Sit down. There is a smith in the second circle who owes me a favour older than you are."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 5,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
          "value": 1
        },
        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Delay": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 4294967295
        },
        "Quest": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "RepliesList": {
          "type": "list",
          "value": [
            {
              "__struct_id": 0,
              "Active": {
                "type": "resref",
                "value": ""
              },
              "Index": {
                "type": "dword",
                "value": 6
              },
              "IsChild": {
                "type": "byte",
                "value": 1
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "Script": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Sound": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*Hallas leans on the parapet.* Sworn, kept, and set in steel. That is the first of it -- and only the first. *He looks east again.* There is a field out there that will want every oath Gondor can raise, and a gate beyond it, and a thing on the wind above both that no man may kill. Not today. Go well, Oathsworn."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 6,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
          "value": 1
        },
        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Delay": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 4294967295
        },
        "Quest": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "RepliesList": {
          "type": "list",
          "value": [
            {
              "__struct_id": 0,
              "Active": {
                "type": "resref",
                "value": ""
              },
              "Index": {
                "type": "dword",
                "value": 6
              },
              "IsChild": {
                "type": "byte",
                "value": 1
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "Script": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Sound": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*The old knight gives you a civil nod and goes back to watching the eastern sky, which is doing nothing at all.*"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 7,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
          "value": 1
        },
        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Delay": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 4294967295
        },
        "Quest": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "RepliesList": {
          "type": "list",
          "value": []
        },
        "Script": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Sound": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*Hallas has you say it out on the wall, in the open, where the wind takes half of it -- and that, he says, is the point; a thing said in a quiet room is only a thought with witnesses. Then he presses a small worn token into your hand.* Keep that where you can feel it. It works no wonder. It only remembers."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 8,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
          "value": 1
        },
        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Delay": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 4294967295
        },
        "Quest": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "RepliesList": {
          "type": "list",
          "value": []
        },
        "Script": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Sound": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*He folds your fingers shut over the sealed parchment himself.* Unbroken, mind. If it comes back opened I shall know, and worse, so shall you."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 9,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
          "value": 1
        },
        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Delay": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 4294967295
        },
        "Quest": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "RepliesList": {
          "type": "list",
          "value": []
        },
        "Script": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Sound": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*The sword is finished: Gondorian steel, plain as a wall, and your sealed oath closed whole into the pommel where the smith bedded it.* There. Now you cannot put it down without noticing. *Hallas almost smiles.* Greater charges will be laid on it than I can give. Carry it until they are."
          }
        }
      }
    ]
